        <mxCell id="evidence-body" value="12,672 unique output words matched 0x00010001. Blocked requests remained stable.&#10;Done stayed low until the last response. The two windows use independent absolute time ranges.&#10;Stimulus: zero X/W with bias 32768. TB, VCD, assertions and source hashes accompany this figure." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#2B4963;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
